Package: nmaplots
Type: Package
Title: Publication-Quality Network Plots for 'netmeta' Objects
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Vanio", "Antunes", email = "vanio.antunes.md@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A single-function companion to the 'netmeta' package. nmaplot()
    takes the object returned by netmeta::netmeta() and draws the evidence
    network with 'ggplot2': node size by sample size or number of studies,
    edge width and labels by number of studies, several layouts (circle,
    star, spring, custom), multi-arm study shading, colour and title control,
    optional grid, and direct export to PNG, PDF or TIFF.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
